    can reveal 1 "Vanquish Soul" monster in your hand instead. During your End Phase,
    if you control 2 or more "Vanquish Soul" monsters: You can Set 1 "Vanquish Soul"
    Trap from your Deck. You can only use each effect of "Vanquish Soul, Start!"
    once per turn.'
